    <description>This flow sends notification to vfs.support.salesforce@volvo.com mailbox if there is integration failure from data backbone to salesforce .
The bulk job is scheduled after the bulk job integration completes on salesforce .Currently the job starts at 8:30 AM and completes at 11 AM CET this this flow is scheduled at 11:30 AM currently</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
